  data: {
    LLM: '1. **Foundations**: Build up in suit from Ace to King. Cards are moved individually.\n2. **Tableau**: Build down alternating colors. Cards may be moved individually or as a group if built down in suit. An empty tableau pile may be filled by any exposed card or in-suit sequence from another tableau.\n3. **Stock**: Tap the stock to turn up 3 cards at a time to the waste pile. Only one redeal is allowed.\n4. **Waste**: The top card is available for play onto the tableau or foundations.',
    Player: '1. **Foundations**: Build up in suit from Ace to King. Cards are moved individually.\n2. **Tableau**: Build down alternating colors. Cards may be moved individually or as a group if built down in suit. An empty tableau pile may be filled by any exposed card or in-suit sequence from another tableau.\n3. **Stock**: Tap the stock to turn up 3 cards at a time to the waste pile. Only one redeal is allowed.\n4. **Waste**: The top card is available for play onto the tableau or foundations.',
    objective: 'Move all 104 cards to the eight foundation piles, building up in suit from Ace to King.',
    gameplay: '1. **Foundations**: Build up in suit from Ace to King. Cards are moved individually.\n2. **Tableau**: Build down alternating colors. Cards may be moved individually or as a group if built down in suit. An empty tableau pile may be filled by any exposed card or in-suit sequence from another tableau.\n3. **Stock**: Tap the stock to turn up 3 cards at a time to the waste pile. Only one redeal is allowed.\n4. **Waste**: The top card is available for play onto the tableau or foundations.',
    keyRules: [
      'Foundations: build up in suit from Ace to King; cards moved individually.',
      'Tableau: build down alternating colors; in-suit sequences may move as a unit; empty pile accepts any card or valid sequence.',
      'Stock: tap to turn 3 cards to waste; only one redeal allowed.',
      'Waste: top card is available for play to tableau or foundations.',
