    turnFlow: '1. **Foundations**: Build up in suit from Ace to King. Cards are moved individually.\n2. **Tableau**: Build down alternating colors. Cards may be moved individually or as a group if built down in suit. An empty tableau pile may be filled by any exposed card or in-suit sequence from another tableau.\n3. **Stock**: Tap the stock to turn up 3 cards at a time to the waste pile. Only one redeal is allowed.\n4. **Waste**: The top card is available for play onto the tableau or foundations.',
